1
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:05,900
Don't let it shake you off!
Hang tight!

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,310
Hang tight!

3
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,780
DESTROY

4
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:16,450
<i>It's going to work!</i>

5
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:17,490
<i>I can do this!</i>

6
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:22,410
<i>Hinokami Kagura...</i>

7
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:23,750
<i>Flame Dance!</i>

8
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,170
<i>I still haven't landed a blow
on the demon!</i>

9
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:31,960
<i>This isn't going to end
until I cut off the main body's head!</i>

10
00:00:34,630 --> 00:00:35,890
<i>It's gone!</i>

11
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:37,340
<i>It ran off again!</i>

12
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:39,470
<i>Where'd it go?</i>

13
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:48,060
You bastard!

14
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:50,400
Don't run away!

15
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:53,070
Don't run away from your responsibilities!

16
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:58,450
You demons who kill and devour humans...

17
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:08,040
Come on, Nezuko, Genya!

18
00:01:12,210 --> 00:01:13,630
<i>Why are you running away?</i>

19
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:18,970
<i>Isn't this just what
you've been doing to humans?</i>

20
00:01:31,940 --> 00:01:33,900
<i>Why are you all...</i>

21
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:36,450
<i>so self-serving?</i>

22
00:01:37,660 --> 00:01:40,870
Behold, "Death Throes of the Smiths"!

23
00:01:41,450 --> 00:01:44,750
Just twist the sword like so, and...

24
00:01:45,750 --> 00:01:46,830
UPPER FIVE

25
00:02:00,090 --> 00:02:05,980
Just now, you tried to slash a small, weak being
who could fit in the palm of your hand.

26
00:02:04,430 --> 00:02:05,980
HATRED

27
00:02:04,430 --> 00:02:09,480
UPPER
FOUR

28
00:02:06,810 --> 00:02:09,480
Utterly atrocious...

29
00:02:17,990 --> 00:02:19,150
<i>And yet...</i>

30
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:21,320
<i>we humans are...</i>

31
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:24,080
<i>always powerless!</i>

32
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,250
You're getting in the way, so go hide.

33
00:02:33,130 --> 00:02:37,090
You piece of crap!

34
00:02:37,670 --> 00:02:39,800
Enough is enough...

35
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:42,890
you stupid moron!

36
00:02:55,020 --> 00:02:56,780
<i>But we're never going to...</i>

37
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:58,490
<i>give up!</i>

38
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:04,410
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA
SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

39
00:03:07,450 --> 00:03:11,950
FINAL EPISODE:
 A CONNECTED BOND:
 DAYBREAK AND FIRST LIGHT

40
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,400
He runs so fast!

41
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:38,280
What's his deal?

42
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:44,030
Dammit!

43
00:03:44,410 --> 00:03:46,120
We'll never catch up!

44
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:49,120
Did he really have
that much strength left in reserve?

45
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:52,080
<i>We'll be reaching our limit soon.</i>

46
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:54,290
<i>If this goes on, he's going to get away!</i>

47
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:57,960
<i>It's almost daybreak!</i>

48
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,260
<i>Ms. Kanroji's reeling off
one powerful attack after another!</i>

49
00:04:01,260 --> 00:04:03,470
<i>It won't be long
before she loses stamina!</i>

50
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:06,680
<i>And when day breaks,
the demons will escape!</i>

51
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:08,680
<i>We've got to hurry!</i>

52
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:14,690
<i>Still...</i>

53
00:04:15,940 --> 00:04:17,190
<i>it's so fast!</i>

54
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,480
<i>Dammit!</i>

55
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,690
<i>He's planning
to keep running forever!</i>

56
00:04:21,030 --> 00:04:22,440
<i>Before day breaks!</i>

57
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:25,030
<i>Until Ms. Kanroji breaks down!</i>

58
00:04:26,030 --> 00:04:27,990
<i>We're not gonna let you do that!</i>

59
00:04:27,990 --> 00:04:29,620
<i>We're not...</i>

60
00:04:29,990 --> 00:04:31,790
<i>gonna let you win!</i>

61
00:04:35,290 --> 00:04:36,420
<i>It's no use!</i>

62
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:38,000
<i>I can't plant my feet!</i>

63
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:41,170
<i>If only I hadn't injured my left leg!</i>

64
00:04:42,590 --> 00:04:45,010
<i>No good! I can't let this happen!</i>

65
00:04:45,300 --> 00:04:47,050
<i>I have to figure this out!</i>

66
00:04:47,930 --> 00:04:49,140
<i>Tanjiro?</i>

67
00:04:50,930 --> 00:04:55,520
<i>Thunder Breathing's all about
focusing on your legs the most.</i>

68
00:04:56,350 --> 00:04:57,610
<i>See...</i>

69
00:04:58,150 --> 00:05:02,400
<i>when it comes to the size of your own body
or the shape of each of your muscles...</i>

70
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:05,610
<i>it's actually hard
to get a good grasp of all that.</i>

71
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:10,870
<i>"It's not true Total Concentration
until you're aware of them all."</i>

72
00:05:11,870 --> 00:05:13,200
<i>That's what...</i>

73
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:16,620
<i>Gramps, my trainer,
was always telling me.</i>

74
00:05:17,460 --> 00:05:20,340
<i>Each and every fiber of my muscles...</i>

75
00:05:20,670 --> 00:05:23,130
<i>Every single vein in my body...</i>

76
00:05:23,130 --> 00:05:24,920
<i>Circulate air throughout them.</i>

77
00:05:27,470 --> 00:05:30,100
<i>Collect all your strength
into your legs only!</i>

78
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:31,970
<i>Collect it!</i>

79
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,680
<i>Let it explode with a single breath!</i>

80
00:05:36,060 --> 00:05:37,690
<i>Slash through the air.</i>

81
00:05:37,690 --> 00:05:38,980
<i>Like thunder!</i>

82
00:05:43,780 --> 00:05:44,860
<i>I see you!</i>

83
00:05:44,860 --> 00:05:45,900
<i>I won't let you escape!</i>

84
00:05:56,870 --> 00:05:58,250
<i>Do it! Do it!</i>

85
00:05:58,250 --> 00:05:59,670
<i>This time for sure!</i>

86
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:02,090
<i>With every ounce of your strength!</i>

87
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:05,670
Don't you...

88
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:09,840
<i>Slash its head! No matter what!</i>

89
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:12,100
...feel the least bit...

90
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:15,720
sorry for me?

91
00:06:16,230 --> 00:06:18,850
Not at all?

92
00:06:20,900 --> 00:06:25,900
Don't you dare bully the weak!

93
00:06:44,380 --> 00:06:46,670
Your so-called reasons...

94
00:06:47,010 --> 00:06:49,680
are all total crap!

95
00:06:49,970 --> 00:06:52,930
You stupid bastard!

96
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:27,130
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

97
00:07:28,670 --> 00:07:30,630
<i>I'm getting burned by these flames, too!</i>

98
00:07:30,630 --> 00:07:32,550
<i>Because I've eaten demon flesh!</i>

99
00:07:33,090 --> 00:07:34,090
Tanjiro!

100
00:08:10,590 --> 00:08:11,800
Tanjiro!

101
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,550
Nezuko!

102
00:08:30,730 --> 00:08:31,900
<i>Damn.</i>

103
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:35,240
<i>My regeneration's slowing down.</i>

104
00:08:35,780 --> 00:08:39,240
<i>Zohakuten's using too much of my power!</i>

105
00:08:39,830 --> 00:08:43,290
<i>I need to replenish myself
with human flesh and blood!</i>

106
00:08:48,290 --> 00:08:50,210
I won't let you escape!

107
00:08:55,470 --> 00:08:56,970
<i>I can sense...</i>

108
00:08:57,720 --> 00:09:00,260
<i>that there are humans...</i>

109
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:03,390
<i>nearby.</i>

110
00:09:04,060 --> 00:09:05,600
Come back here.

111
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:12,570
I'm not gonna let you escape!

112
00:09:16,780 --> 00:09:21,540
I'll chase you down
even if you flee to the depths of hell!

113
00:09:21,910 --> 00:09:23,040
And...

114
00:09:23,830 --> 00:09:25,290
I'm gonna cut off your head!

115
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:31,170
<i>He dares to threaten me?</i>

116
00:09:32,550 --> 00:09:34,470
<i>Where are those humans?</i>

117
00:09:35,090 --> 00:09:37,340
<i>If I consume them...</i>

118
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:42,310
<i>then I can send that little brat
to his demise in a flash!</i>

119
00:09:42,810 --> 00:09:43,640
<i>Huh?</i>

120
00:09:45,020 --> 00:09:46,390
<i>There they are!</i>

121
00:09:47,100 --> 00:09:49,520
<i>I've found some food!</i>

122
00:09:50,060 --> 00:09:53,570
<i>Of those three brats,
one is a demon and a handful!</i>

123
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:56,530
<i>Thwarting me at every turn!</i>

124
00:09:57,030 --> 00:10:02,540
<i>As it turns out, that brat's sword can only
lodge itself into my neck, not slash it.</i>

125
00:10:02,540 --> 00:10:07,290
<i>First, let me devour those humans,
and when I've replenished myself...</i>

126
00:10:07,670 --> 00:10:10,420
Oh, crap! That way!

127
00:10:10,750 --> 00:10:11,540
Right!

128
00:10:12,460 --> 00:10:13,500
Come back here!

129
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:16,170
You're not getting away!

130
00:10:23,930 --> 00:10:25,180
Nezuko...

131
00:10:32,020 --> 00:10:33,400
<i>Get going!</i>

132
00:10:34,070 --> 00:10:35,530
<i>You've got to hurry!</i>

133
00:10:35,990 --> 00:10:37,780
<i>One more time!</i>

134
00:10:38,650 --> 00:10:40,200
<i>One more time...</i>

135
00:10:40,570 --> 00:10:43,450
<i>Use Total Concentration
to push off against the ground!</i>

136
00:10:45,660 --> 00:10:47,500
Tanjiro!

137
00:10:52,750 --> 00:10:54,590
Tanjiro!

138
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:58,420
Tanjiro!

139
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,770
My sword!

140
00:11:10,230 --> 00:11:11,440
Use it!

141
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,440
To...

142
00:11:18,740 --> 00:11:20,650
Tanjiro, use that sword!

143
00:11:20,650 --> 00:11:22,240
Give that back!

144
00:11:22,780 --> 00:11:24,330
You've got to be kidding me!

145
00:11:24,330 --> 00:11:26,160
I'll kill you! Don't use it!

146
00:11:26,450 --> 00:11:28,540
I've only honed it up to the first stage!

147
00:11:28,540 --> 00:11:29,830
Give it back!

148
00:11:29,830 --> 00:11:31,170
Tanjiro!

149
00:11:31,460 --> 00:11:34,170
It's almost daybreak!
He's going to get away!

150
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:37,920
You stupid brat!

151
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:38,960
Ouch!

152
00:11:41,180 --> 00:11:42,470
<i>Tokito...</i>

153
00:11:43,970 --> 00:11:45,180
<i>Thank you!</i>

154
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:51,230
I'm counting on you...

155
00:11:51,230 --> 00:11:52,190
Tanjiro.

156
00:11:53,150 --> 00:11:54,020
Mr. Tokito?

157
00:11:54,020 --> 00:11:54,650
Huh?

158
00:11:54,650 --> 00:11:55,860
Lord Tokito?

159
00:11:55,860 --> 00:11:56,940
Whoa!

160
00:11:56,940 --> 00:11:59,240
Mr. Haganezuka murdered Mr. Tokito!

161
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:01,530
What the hell? I didn't do anything!

162
00:12:01,530 --> 00:12:02,610
You inhuman monster!

163
00:12:02,610 --> 00:12:04,530
It's the poison and fever!

164
00:12:04,530 --> 00:12:06,490
Calm down, both of you!

165
00:12:07,410 --> 00:12:08,740
<i>Take it...</i>

166
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:09,870
<i>Tanjiro.</i>

167
00:12:18,750 --> 00:12:22,590
<i>Everyone's hopes are in that sword.</i>

168
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:26,720
<i>Total Concentration...</i>

169
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,790
<i>Dancing Flash!</i>

170
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:05,970
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA
SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

171
00:13:05,970 --> 00:13:10,970
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA
SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

172
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:19,060
<i>I did it!</i>

173
00:13:19,060 --> 00:13:21,360
<i>I cut off the head of the main body!</i>

174
00:13:22,110 --> 00:13:24,110
<i>I did it!</i>

175
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:33,120
<i>The sun is rising!</i>

176
00:13:38,210 --> 00:13:40,090
<i>She shouldn't be
in this wide-open space!</i>

177
00:13:40,500 --> 00:13:42,340
Nezuko... Run!

178
00:13:42,340 --> 00:13:43,260
Get—

179
00:13:46,630 --> 00:13:48,720
<i>I can't... get a word out!</i>

180
00:13:51,890 --> 00:13:53,680
<i>No! Nezuko!</i>

181
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:55,230
<i>You don't have to come this way!</i>

182
00:13:55,730 --> 00:13:57,900
<i>It's you! It's you!</i>

183
00:13:57,900 --> 00:14:00,230
<i>You're the one in danger!
Because the sun's coming up...</i>

184
00:14:01,070 --> 00:14:03,730
<i>if the sunlight hits you,
you're going to die!</i>

185
00:14:06,860 --> 00:14:08,070
<i>Nezuko!</i>

186
00:14:13,660 --> 00:14:15,580
N-Nezuk—

187
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,160
Run!

188
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:21,670
Find a place in the shade!

189
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,420
Nezuko!

190
00:14:29,470 --> 00:14:30,850
Run! Run!

191
00:14:31,470 --> 00:14:32,680
It's not dead!

192
00:14:33,390 --> 00:14:35,930
Even though it's been beheaded!

193
00:14:43,610 --> 00:14:46,610
RESENTMENT

194
00:14:44,190 --> 00:14:45,360
<i>The word on its tongue is...</i>

195
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:46,610
<i>"resentment"?</i>

196
00:14:47,190 --> 00:14:49,360
<i>The main body's tongue
had the word "fear"!</i>

197
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:53,120
FEAR

198
00:14:49,660 --> 00:14:51,240
<i>This one has a different word!</i>

199
00:14:53,410 --> 00:14:54,540
<i>I messed up!</i>

200
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:56,750
<i>I have to stop it!</i>

201
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:59,210
<i>I have to finish it off!</i>

202
00:15:24,150 --> 00:15:25,570
Nezuko!

203
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:27,280
Make yourself smaller!

204
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:29,570
Shrink your body!

205
00:15:29,900 --> 00:15:31,450
Shrink it!

206
00:15:36,870 --> 00:15:40,290
<i>The sun's not even all the way up,
and look how bad it is!</i>

207
00:15:43,380 --> 00:15:44,590
<i>Nezuko...</i>

208
00:15:53,260 --> 00:15:54,640
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

209
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:56,640
<i>Somebody...</i>

210
00:15:59,060 --> 00:16:00,480
<i>Genya...</i>

211
00:16:02,850 --> 00:16:04,270
<i>Tokito...</i>

212
00:16:09,820 --> 00:16:11,900
<i>Who am I kidding?</i>

213
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:14,370
<i>They can't get here
from the top of that cliff!</i>

214
00:16:15,870 --> 00:16:18,740
<i>Wait! That demon should be burning, too!</i>

215
00:16:19,620 --> 00:16:20,790
<i>No good!</i>

216
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:23,120
<i>By then, the villagers will be dead!</i>

217
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:27,130
<i>If I run while carrying Nezuko...</i>

218
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:30,170
<i>I won't make it in time!</i>

219
00:17:08,170 --> 00:17:09,750
<i>I can't do it!</i>

220
00:17:11,550 --> 00:17:13,420
<i>I can't make up my mind!</i>

221
00:17:24,850 --> 00:17:27,020
<i>I can't make up...</i>

222
00:20:36,040 --> 00:20:37,500
<i>Sniff it out.</i>

223
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:41,170
<i>It can't have gotten that far!</i>

224
00:20:48,930 --> 00:20:51,890
<i>If the main body had gone off
somewhere far away so fast...</i>

225
00:20:51,890 --> 00:20:53,890
<i>the scent would've told me!</i>

226
00:20:54,810 --> 00:20:56,270
<i>It's nearby!</i>

227
00:20:56,810 --> 00:20:57,860
<i>Where is it?</i>

228
00:20:58,110 --> 00:20:59,480
<i>Pick up its scent!</i>

229
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:02,190
<i>Its shape!</i>

230
00:21:02,780 --> 00:21:03,820
<i>Its color!</i>

231
00:21:13,040 --> 00:21:14,120
<i>There it is!</i>

232
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:17,500
<i>It's still inside the demon!</i>

233
00:21:18,880 --> 00:21:20,050
<i>Right!</i>

234
00:21:20,590 --> 00:21:21,670
<i>Clearer...</i>

235
00:21:22,260 --> 00:21:24,050
<i>Give me a clearer view!</i>

236
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:25,840
<i>Clearer!</i>

237
00:21:29,310 --> 00:21:30,850
<i>Found it!</i>

238
00:21:30,850 --> 00:21:32,680
<i>Inside its heart!</i>

239
00:21:35,600 --> 00:21:37,940
We're done for! We're done for!

240
00:21:38,230 --> 00:21:39,360
It caught up—

241
00:21:41,440 --> 00:21:43,610
You're finished for sure this time!

242
00:21:43,940 --> 00:21:45,360
You coward!

243
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:46,570
You evil demon!

244
00:21:52,620 --> 00:21:54,160
Atone for your sins...

245
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:02,760
with your life!

246
00:22:09,350 --> 00:22:12,560
<i>Why would you steal from others?</i>

247
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:15,140
<i>And even worse...</i>

248
00:22:15,140 --> 00:22:19,150
<i>from a man who was so kind
to those of us who cannot see...</i>

249
00:22:19,730 --> 00:22:23,400
<i>The Master has chosen
to look the other way,</i>

250
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:25,610
<i>but I cannot forgive you.</i>

251
00:22:26,360 --> 00:22:28,360
<i>I am going to the magistrate's office now.</i>

252
00:22:29,450 --> 00:22:31,870
<i>I'm not the one at fault here!</i>

253
00:22:31,870 --> 00:22:33,870
<i>It's these hands that are to blame!</i>

254
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:36,870
<i>These hands acted on their own!</i>

255
00:22:38,710 --> 00:22:40,710
<i>What the hell is this?</i>

256
00:22:45,630 --> 00:22:48,260
<i>Is that me when I was a human?</i>

257
00:22:48,760 --> 00:22:50,930
<i>Why now after all this time?</i>

258
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:58,060
<i>I'm told you've committed theft and murder
numerous times in another town, as well.</i>

259
00:22:58,390 --> 00:23:00,060
<i>I have absolutely no sympathy for you!</i>

260
00:23:00,650 --> 00:23:02,110
<i>That's absurd!</i>

261
00:23:02,110 --> 00:23:04,780
<i>I'm not even capable of such a thing!</i>

262
00:23:04,780 --> 00:23:06,440
<i>As someone who's blind...</i>

263
00:23:06,820 --> 00:23:09,450
<i>I know that you can see just fine!</i>

264
00:23:11,370 --> 00:23:14,620
<i>I've had a masseur
come here to Shirasu...</i>

265
00:23:14,620 --> 00:23:18,870
<i>and he would face the wall
until I started speaking.</i>

266
00:23:20,290 --> 00:23:22,420
<i>You say that your hands are to blame?</i>

267
00:23:23,170 --> 00:23:24,920
<i>Then, we'll just slice...</i>

268
00:23:25,340 --> 00:23:26,920
<i>both of them off!</i>

269
00:23:28,300 --> 00:23:31,470
<i>You're going to be beheaded
tomorrow? I pity you.</i>

270
00:23:32,260 --> 00:23:34,970
<i>Let me save you.</i>

271
00:23:36,060 --> 00:23:40,730
<i>No matter how you may try to talk your way
out of it, the facts remain the same!</i>

272
00:23:40,730 --> 00:23:43,520
<i>Silencing me will do you no good!</i>

273
00:23:44,690 --> 00:23:46,280
<i>Is this...</i>

274
00:23:46,730 --> 00:23:49,990
<i>The day will surely come
when you atone for your sins...</i>

275
00:23:49,990 --> 00:23:53,320
<i>with that vile life of yours!</i>

276
00:23:53,820 --> 00:23:58,500
UPPER FOUR

277
00:23:55,950 --> 00:23:58,500
<i>...my life flashing before my eyes?</i>

278
00:25:01,020 --> 00:25:02,310
<i>I won...</i>

279
00:25:03,390 --> 00:25:05,480
<i>but I had to sacrifice Nezuko!</i>

280
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:08,520
<i>Burned by the sunlight!</i>

281
00:25:09,150 --> 00:25:11,360
<i>Not even Nezuko's bones remain!</i>

282
00:25:28,750 --> 00:25:30,460
Nezuko...

283
00:25:30,460 --> 00:25:32,210
Nezuko!

284
00:25:33,760 --> 00:25:36,640
To turn Nezuko back into a human...

285
00:25:37,640 --> 00:25:38,760
That was why...

286
00:25:39,970 --> 00:25:43,560
That was why I came this far!

287
00:25:45,730 --> 00:25:46,770
Lord Kamado...

288
00:25:47,810 --> 00:25:50,070
L-Lord Kamado?

289
00:25:50,400 --> 00:25:51,900
Lord Kamado!

290
00:25:55,110 --> 00:25:56,700
Lord Kamado...

291
00:26:41,120 --> 00:26:41,950
Mo...

292
00:26:45,040 --> 00:26:46,210
Mo...

293
00:26:52,130 --> 00:26:54,210
Morning!

294
00:27:00,850 --> 00:27:02,600
Nezuko!

295
00:27:04,970 --> 00:27:06,390
Lord Kamado!

296
00:27:22,490 --> 00:27:24,160
Nezuko...

297
00:27:26,410 --> 00:27:28,040
Thank goodness!

298
00:27:28,540 --> 00:27:32,540
Are you all right?

299
00:27:33,040 --> 00:27:34,300
Thank...

300
00:27:34,300 --> 00:27:36,050
Thank goodness.

301
00:27:36,510 --> 00:27:37,460
Are you...

302
00:27:37,800 --> 00:27:40,300
Are you all right?

303
00:27:44,680 --> 00:27:47,100
Thank goodness, right?

304
00:27:47,980 --> 00:27:49,310
Right?

305
00:27:50,810 --> 00:27:53,190
No, really...

306
00:27:53,560 --> 00:27:55,440
thank goodness...

307
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:58,440
you didn't turn to ash and disappear!

308
00:28:06,040 --> 00:28:08,000
Thank goodness!

309
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:12,120
I thought that you were dead!

310
00:28:12,460 --> 00:28:15,250
Thank goodness, Nezuko!

311
00:28:15,250 --> 00:28:17,550
I'm so glad you're all right!

312
00:28:18,010 --> 00:28:20,090
Thank goodness!

313
00:28:20,090 --> 00:28:22,220
Yes, thank goodness!

314
00:28:27,220 --> 00:28:30,350
Thanks, both of you, for saving us!

315
00:28:30,350 --> 00:28:34,060
We never could've forgiven ourselves
if Nezuko had perished!

316
00:28:43,610 --> 00:28:45,070
Good for you...

317
00:28:45,410 --> 00:28:46,700
Tanjiro...

318
00:28:47,030 --> 00:28:48,410
Nezuko!

319
00:28:51,580 --> 00:28:53,670
He hit the wall all of a sudden!

320
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:56,170
Young Kamado, hang in there!

321
00:28:56,170 --> 00:28:57,460
Is he dead? Is he dead?

322
00:28:57,460 --> 00:28:58,170
Idiot!

323
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:00,210
Are you all right?

324
00:29:00,210 --> 00:29:01,550
Stay with us!

325
00:29:02,800 --> 00:29:04,680
Thank goodness...

326
00:29:05,930 --> 00:29:07,300
Nezuko...

327
00:29:08,890 --> 00:29:10,520
Thank goodness.

328
00:29:31,500 --> 00:29:33,330
I can't take it any more!

329
00:29:36,670 --> 00:29:38,290
I'm so sorry!

330
00:29:38,290 --> 00:29:40,050
I'm about to be killed!

331
00:29:50,310 --> 00:29:51,060
Huh?

332
00:30:03,150 --> 00:30:05,400
Yay! I'm saved!

333
00:30:05,990 --> 00:30:09,580
Tanjiro and the others
must've beheaded the main body!

334
00:30:19,040 --> 00:30:20,380
Toshikuni?

335
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:23,670
I'm coming in, all right?

336
00:30:24,920 --> 00:30:26,130
Oh my...

337
00:30:29,510 --> 00:30:31,600
What's gotten into you, Toshikuni?

338
00:30:31,600 --> 00:30:33,970
Making such a mess...

339
00:30:34,270 --> 00:30:36,520
I see that you've been doing some research.

340
00:30:36,890 --> 00:30:39,270
You can't find the book that you need?

341
00:30:39,770 --> 00:30:42,110
I'll help you find it.

342
00:30:42,110 --> 00:30:44,150
But first, take a break.

343
00:30:44,150 --> 00:30:45,990
Let's have some tea.

344
00:30:46,490 --> 00:30:48,280
At last...

345
00:30:48,570 --> 00:30:50,240
What's that?

346
00:30:50,990 --> 00:30:56,120
At last, someone able
to withstand the sun has appeared!

347
00:30:56,120 --> 00:30:59,120
Good work, Hantengu!

348
00:30:59,500 --> 00:31:01,960
Well, you certainly seem
to be enjoying yourself.

349
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:04,760
Perhaps it's the stories
you've been reading—

350
00:31:05,090 --> 00:31:05,920
Huh?

351
00:31:11,180 --> 00:31:14,010
Huh? Madam?

352
00:31:14,010 --> 00:31:15,680
What happened...

353
00:31:15,680 --> 00:31:17,520
to your head?

354
00:31:17,890 --> 00:31:19,810
Now...

355
00:31:19,810 --> 00:31:23,570
there's no need to search
for the Blue Spider Lily.

356
00:31:23,570 --> 00:31:24,530
Madam...

357
00:31:25,150 --> 00:31:26,940
That took so long.

358
00:31:26,940 --> 00:31:31,530
But it was for this reason,
for this reason, for one thousand years...

359
00:31:31,870 --> 00:31:36,790
that I've continued
to increase my kind unwillingly!

360
00:31:44,750 --> 00:31:50,430
A rare constitution that never showed up
even among the Twelve Kizuki.

361
00:31:50,430 --> 00:31:52,550
The chosen demon.

362
00:31:52,930 --> 00:31:56,310
If I devour that girl and absorb her...

363
00:31:56,310 --> 00:31:59,940
I, too, will be able to conquer the sun!

364
00:31:59,940 --> 00:32:02,940
You murderer! You murderer!
You monster!

365
00:32:02,940 --> 00:32:05,400
Master! Master!

366
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:06,230
Ma—

367
00:32:20,540 --> 00:32:23,040
<i>Now that I think of it, it was on that day.</i>

368
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:28,050
<i>It all started one thousand years ago.</i>

369
00:32:28,550 --> 00:32:32,550
<i>The era was still called Heian back then.</i>

370
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:35,550
If I may, sir...

371
00:32:35,930 --> 00:32:40,060
Your medicine is ready for you now.

372
00:32:40,810 --> 00:32:42,810
You inept doctor...

373
00:32:43,980 --> 00:32:49,150
That said, this inept doctor
is the only one I have to lean on.

374
00:32:50,690 --> 00:32:52,200
What will become of me...

375
00:32:52,530 --> 00:32:54,450
if I don't take this?

376
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:57,120
As you know...

377
00:32:57,120 --> 00:32:59,370
you will not live...

378
00:32:59,370 --> 00:33:01,830
to see your 20th birthday.

379
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:04,120
I am doing all I can...

380
00:33:04,120 --> 00:33:06,840
to help you live...

381
00:33:06,840 --> 00:33:09,340
even a little longer.

382
00:33:10,300 --> 00:33:11,470
All right, fine.

383
00:33:11,470 --> 00:33:13,130
That's enough.

384
00:33:15,760 --> 00:33:18,100
<i>It won't work anyway.</i>

385
00:33:23,100 --> 00:33:24,900
<i>Ah...</i>

386
00:33:24,900 --> 00:33:26,610
<i>I want to destroy them!</i>

387
00:33:26,610 --> 00:33:29,280
<i>Every living being!</i>

388
00:33:31,320 --> 00:33:34,320
<i>No matter how many times
he examines me...</i>

389
00:33:34,320 --> 00:33:36,780
<i>or administers that medicine...</i>

390
00:33:37,200 --> 00:33:40,290
<i>nothing can stop
my symptoms from worsening.</i>

391
00:33:54,840 --> 00:33:57,340
Death is all you deserve!

392
00:33:57,340 --> 00:33:59,560
You damn incompetent doctor!

393
00:34:00,220 --> 00:34:05,900
<i>But then I realized that this doctor's
medicine was working...</i>

394
00:34:05,900 --> 00:34:09,440
<i>not longer after I'd killed him.</i>

395
00:34:10,480 --> 00:34:13,570
<i>My body was bursting with energy...</i>

396
00:34:13,570 --> 00:34:17,780
<i>and I thought that I'd gained
a durable physique...</i>

397
00:34:17,780 --> 00:34:20,200
<i>but there was one problem.</i>

398
00:34:20,950 --> 00:34:24,290
<i>I couldn't walk in the sunlight.</i>

399
00:34:34,050 --> 00:34:36,260
<i>I could tell.</i>

400
00:34:36,260 --> 00:34:39,680
<i>That if exposed to sunlight, I would die.</i>

401
00:34:49,310 --> 00:34:52,650
<i>I began to crave human flesh and blood.</i>

402
00:34:53,110 --> 00:34:54,650
<i>To remedy that...</i>

403
00:34:54,650 --> 00:34:56,950
<i>all I had to do was devour humans.</i>

404
00:34:59,780 --> 00:35:04,080
If anyone stands in your way,
just eliminate them.

405
00:35:04,540 --> 00:35:06,870
That's all there is to it.

406
00:35:06,870 --> 00:35:08,290
Come back here!

407
00:35:08,290 --> 00:35:11,130
You cursed demon who disrupts
the peace of the capital!

408
00:35:13,920 --> 00:35:15,420
Are you...

409
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:19,260
talking about me?

410
00:35:33,230 --> 00:35:35,860
<i>I had gained power.</i>

411
00:35:36,190 --> 00:35:38,610
<i>Eternal power!</i>

412
00:35:41,660 --> 00:35:43,160
<i>But...</i>

413
00:35:43,160 --> 00:35:47,660
<i>having to restrict my movements
during the day was humiliating...</i>

414
00:35:47,660 --> 00:35:50,750
<i>and my anger only grew.</i>

415
00:35:51,250 --> 00:35:56,510
<i>I began to seek a body
that wouldn't perish in the sunlight.</i>

416
00:35:57,510 --> 00:36:00,890
<i>I examined the compounds
for the doctor's elixir,</i>

417
00:36:00,890 --> 00:36:03,470
<i>but perhaps because it was still
in the experimental stages,</i>

418
00:36:03,470 --> 00:36:09,440
<i>I couldn't figure out how to make
the medicine called "Blue Spider Lily."</i>

419
00:36:09,850 --> 00:36:15,610
<i>It did seem to contain actual
blue-colored Spider Lilies...</i>

420
00:36:15,610 --> 00:36:22,620
<i>but as for where this Blue Spider Lily bloomed
or whether or not it could be cultivated...</i>

421
00:36:23,160 --> 00:36:26,160
<i>no one knew but the doctor I'd killed.</i>

422
00:36:26,160 --> 00:36:29,870
<i>I searched all over Japan
but failed to find it.</i>

423
00:36:31,000 --> 00:36:35,170
<i>In order to become truly immortal...</i>

424
00:36:35,630 --> 00:36:38,130
<i>finding the Blue Spider Lily...</i>

425
00:36:38,130 --> 00:36:42,260
<i>and someone who had the ability
to survive the sunlight...</i>

426
00:36:42,680 --> 00:36:46,640
<i>Those two have been my top priorities.</i>

427
00:36:49,730 --> 00:36:51,640
<i>And at last...</i>

428
00:36:52,020 --> 00:36:53,650
<i>I've found her!</i>

429
00:36:58,190 --> 00:37:01,780
<i>Since that girl has conquered the sun...</i>

430
00:37:02,110 --> 00:37:06,030
<i>there's no longer any reason
to increase my kind.</i>

431
00:37:06,330 --> 00:37:08,330
<i>I will absorb her...</i>

432
00:37:08,330 --> 00:37:12,420
<i>and then I will conquer the sunlight.</i>

433
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:15,380
<i>I will get my hands on Nezuko...</i>

434
00:37:15,380 --> 00:37:19,760
<i>and become a perfect being!</i>

435
00:37:23,630 --> 00:37:26,260
Tanjiro, are you all right?

436
00:37:28,930 --> 00:37:30,100
Hey...

437
00:37:30,100 --> 00:37:32,980
T-Tokito...

438
00:37:34,150 --> 00:37:35,560
Thank goodness...

439
00:37:35,560 --> 00:37:36,940
you're safe!

440
00:37:37,360 --> 00:37:39,940
Thank you for my sword!

441
00:37:40,820 --> 00:37:43,070
I should be thanking you.

442
00:37:43,070 --> 00:37:46,820
Because of you, I recovered
something precious that I'd lost.

443
00:37:47,200 --> 00:37:49,830
Huh? No...

444
00:37:49,830 --> 00:37:51,830
but I didn't do anything.

445
00:37:52,750 --> 00:37:54,120
It's all right.

446
00:37:54,120 --> 00:37:56,460
Thank you from the bottom of my heart!

447
00:37:57,420 --> 00:37:59,710
Tokito...

448
00:38:00,300 --> 00:38:03,800
Anyway, what's going on with Nezuko?

449
00:38:04,180 --> 00:38:06,010
Well, actually...

450
00:38:06,010 --> 00:38:08,100
Why, you...

451
00:38:11,180 --> 00:38:13,350
What did you do with my sword?

452
00:38:13,350 --> 00:38:14,730
Calm down!

453
00:38:15,020 --> 00:38:15,940
Huh?

454
00:38:16,650 --> 00:38:17,860
Mr. Haganezuka?

455
00:38:18,190 --> 00:38:22,490
I asked you what happened
to the sword I was honing!

456
00:38:22,490 --> 00:38:24,700
I used it to fight an Upper Rank!

457
00:38:24,700 --> 00:38:26,780
Yeah, to fight?

458
00:38:26,780 --> 00:38:28,370
To fight, and...

459
00:38:28,370 --> 00:38:29,450
Huh?

460
00:38:29,450 --> 00:38:30,990
What happened then?

461
00:38:30,990 --> 00:38:33,000
I blacked out, and...

462
00:38:33,620 --> 00:38:35,500
Oh, the sword? I've got it—

463
00:38:35,500 --> 00:38:36,620
You broke it, right?

464
00:38:37,330 --> 00:38:38,540
Uh, no.

465
00:38:38,540 --> 00:38:41,300
You broke it, didn't you? Tell me the truth!

466
00:38:41,300 --> 00:38:43,340
Tell! Me! The! Truth!

467
00:38:43,340 --> 00:38:45,300
I didn't... I didn't...

468
00:38:45,300 --> 00:38:46,680
No, it's right here!

469
00:38:46,680 --> 00:38:48,510
I'm going to kill you!

470
00:38:48,510 --> 00:38:50,050
Nezuko, run!

471
00:38:50,050 --> 00:38:51,010
Run!

472
00:38:51,010 --> 00:38:52,220
You're not getting away!

473
00:38:52,520 --> 00:38:54,890
Mr. Haganezuka! Calm down!

474
00:38:54,890 --> 00:38:56,810
Come back here!
Come back here!

475
00:38:54,890 --> 00:38:57,350
The sword is right here!

476
00:38:56,810 --> 00:38:58,650
Like hell, I'll calm down!

477
00:38:57,940 --> 00:39:00,560
- Come on, come on!
- You guys!

478
00:39:01,150 --> 00:39:03,480
You guys!

479
00:39:06,700 --> 00:39:08,490
Ms. Kanroji!

480
00:39:16,710 --> 00:39:19,540
We won! We won!

481
00:39:19,540 --> 00:39:21,630
We all won together!

482
00:39:21,630 --> 00:39:24,880
So amazing! We're all alive!

483
00:39:25,170 --> 00:39:27,470
Thank goodness!

484
00:39:28,050 --> 00:39:30,260
Yes, thank goodness!

485
00:39:34,020 --> 00:39:34,810
Huh?

486
00:39:34,810 --> 00:39:35,850
Yes...

487
00:39:35,850 --> 00:39:38,020
thank goodness!

488
00:39:39,400 --> 00:39:41,860
Whaaaaat?

489
00:39:49,780 --> 00:39:51,070
Tanjiro!

490
00:39:51,570 --> 00:39:52,580
Yes?

491
00:39:55,450 --> 00:39:58,250
Thank goodness!

492
00:39:59,250 --> 00:40:01,000
She's talking...

493
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:03,250
but her eyes and fangs are the same...

494
00:40:03,630 --> 00:40:06,380
so I'm not sure what's going on, but I...

495
00:40:06,710 --> 00:40:08,880
I'm so glad that Nezuko's alive!

496
00:40:09,260 --> 00:40:11,470
Thank goodness she's alive!

497
00:40:12,930 --> 00:40:14,600
Yes! Yes!

498
00:40:15,010 --> 00:40:17,140
Thank goodness!

499
00:40:17,930 --> 00:40:20,640
Thank goodness!

500
00:40:21,230 --> 00:40:23,270
Thank goodness!

501
00:40:23,810 --> 00:40:26,030
Thank goodness!

502
00:40:28,070 --> 00:40:30,450
Thank goodness!

503
00:40:31,280 --> 00:40:32,740
<i>Tanjiro...</i>

504
00:40:33,410 --> 00:40:36,910
<i>I thank you for providing me
with the Twelve Kizuki's and Nezuko's blood...</i>

505
00:40:36,910 --> 00:40:40,290
<i>and for helping me with my research.</i>

506
00:40:45,090 --> 00:40:49,050
<i>The man in Asakusa
who was turned into a demon by Muzan...</i>

507
00:40:49,050 --> 00:40:51,510
<i>has regained his sense of self.</i>

508
00:40:51,970 --> 00:40:54,300
<i>It's thanks to Nezuko's blood.</i>

509
00:40:55,430 --> 00:40:57,810
<i>Released from Muzan's control...</i>

510
00:40:58,180 --> 00:41:01,310
<i>he can live on a small amount of blood.</i>

511
00:41:01,600 --> 00:41:05,690
<i>The transformation of Nezuko's blood
surprises me.</i>

512
00:41:05,980 --> 00:41:11,700
<i>In such a short time, the components
of her blood have changed again and again.</i>

513
00:41:21,160 --> 00:41:22,620
<i>All this time...</i>

514
00:41:22,620 --> 00:41:24,500
<i>I have been thinking.</i>

515
00:41:25,290 --> 00:41:28,380
<i>Why it is that Nezuko has yet to regain
her sense of self...</i>

516
00:41:28,710 --> 00:41:32,260
<i>and remains in a child-like state?</i>

517
00:41:32,930 --> 00:41:34,260
<i>I believe that...</i>

518
00:41:34,260 --> 00:41:36,180
<i>in Nezuko's mind...</i>

519
00:41:36,180 --> 00:41:39,020
<i>there's something more important
than regaining her sense of self...</i>

520
00:41:39,020 --> 00:41:42,230
<i>something that she needs to prioritize.</i>

521
00:41:44,440 --> 00:41:45,480
Yushiro?

522
00:41:45,770 --> 00:41:46,650
Yushiro?

523
00:41:47,860 --> 00:41:49,860
Yes, Lady Tamayo?

524
00:41:49,860 --> 00:41:51,280
What can I do for you?

525
00:41:51,280 --> 00:41:53,030
Can you summon Chachamaru for me?

526
00:41:57,830 --> 00:42:01,160
Chachamaru is ready to go now.

527
00:42:07,250 --> 00:42:10,630
Give my regards
to Tanjiro and Nezuko, okay?

528
00:42:18,930 --> 00:42:20,310
<i>Tanjiro...</i>

529
00:42:20,640 --> 00:42:24,520
<i>This is pure speculation on my part.</i>

530
00:42:25,730 --> 00:42:28,190
<i>But I believe that it won't be long...</i>

531
00:42:29,230 --> 00:42:32,360
<i>before Nezuko can conquer the sun.</i>

532
00:42:41,910 --> 00:42:42,870
Right!

533
00:42:46,920 --> 00:42:48,040
Thanks!

534
00:42:48,750 --> 00:42:50,130
Understood!

535
00:43:00,430 --> 00:43:02,770
Lord Tecchin!

536
00:43:03,390 --> 00:43:05,390
Oh! Kotetsu!

537
00:43:06,190 --> 00:43:09,900
Mr. Tanjiro's leaving the village,
so he'd like to say goodbye.

538
00:43:13,110 --> 00:43:14,320
Mr. Tanjiro?

539
00:43:18,410 --> 00:43:30,500
HYOTTOKO

540
00:43:21,330 --> 00:43:23,740
Are you feeling all right?

541
00:43:23,740 --> 00:43:27,120
Yes! Thank you
for all that you did for me.

542
00:43:27,120 --> 00:43:28,290
And thank you.

543
00:43:28,290 --> 00:43:30,500
You even provided me
with this cart.

544
00:43:31,000 --> 00:43:33,960
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

545
00:43:33,960 --> 00:43:36,670
You did a good job protecting this village!

546
00:43:36,670 --> 00:43:38,180
I'm grateful to you!

547
00:43:38,510 --> 00:43:41,600
I wasn't able to do that much on my own.

548
00:43:42,050 --> 00:43:43,810
It was everyone pulling together!

549
00:43:44,220 --> 00:43:45,850
Our combined strength...

550
00:43:45,850 --> 00:43:50,150
and that sword that's been connecting us
to centuries of hopes until today.

551
00:43:50,150 --> 00:43:52,940
That's why we were able to defeat
those Upper Rank demons.

552
00:43:53,270 --> 00:43:54,780
Yes, yes.

553
00:43:54,780 --> 00:43:56,440
You're right.

554
00:43:57,240 --> 00:43:59,110
And where's your sister?

555
00:43:59,950 --> 00:44:01,410
She's asleep.

556
00:44:01,410 --> 00:44:03,580
Since I really exhausted her.

557
00:44:11,580 --> 00:44:12,840
I see!

558
00:44:12,840 --> 00:44:15,420
I'm truly glad that she's all right!

559
00:44:16,760 --> 00:44:18,010
Yes!

560
00:44:19,220 --> 00:44:20,380
Huh?

561
00:44:23,550 --> 00:44:28,230
Hey, Kanamori! Is that Hotaru
lurking around over there?

562
00:44:28,230 --> 00:44:29,480
Yes.

563
00:44:29,480 --> 00:44:31,270
What is he doing?

564
00:44:31,270 --> 00:44:33,980
He seems to think that he's hiding...

565
00:44:33,980 --> 00:44:38,150
but apparently, he can't forgive Tanjiro
for using a sword before it was fully honed.

566
00:44:38,150 --> 00:44:39,650
Huh?

567
00:44:39,950 --> 00:44:42,280
What am I going to do with that guy?

568
00:44:42,280 --> 00:44:43,370
Hotaru!

569
00:44:43,370 --> 00:44:45,120
Come over here a second!

570
00:44:47,750 --> 00:44:50,500
I said, come over here!

571
00:44:55,800 --> 00:44:57,050
Hotaru!

572
00:44:57,630 --> 00:44:59,470
I'm telling you, it's all his fault.

573
00:45:00,340 --> 00:45:01,340
Ouch!

574
00:45:01,630 --> 00:45:03,260
Right? Am I right?

575
00:45:03,260 --> 00:45:04,350
Am I right?

576
00:45:03,890 --> 00:45:06,560
Hey! Come on... Hey!

577
00:45:04,350 --> 00:45:05,300
Sorry!

578
00:45:05,300 --> 00:45:06,890
Ouch! That hurts!

579
00:45:06,890 --> 00:45:07,720
Hotaru!

580
00:45:08,020 --> 00:45:10,690
But... if Mr. Tanjiro
and the others hadn't come...

581
00:45:10,690 --> 00:45:13,230
I'm sure the village
would've been destroyed!

582
00:45:13,560 --> 00:45:15,440
Ow! Ow!

583
00:45:15,440 --> 00:45:16,400
Hah!

584
00:45:18,610 --> 00:45:19,820
Now, Hotaru...

585
00:45:20,190 --> 00:45:23,610
the real reason you came here
was to speak to Tanjiro...

586
00:45:23,610 --> 00:45:26,160
who came all the way here, right?

587
00:45:29,830 --> 00:45:31,370
Mr. Haganezuka...

588
00:45:31,370 --> 00:45:35,210
Thank you for always
taking care of my sword!

589
00:45:35,630 --> 00:45:37,340
I came to this village...

590
00:45:37,340 --> 00:45:39,590
because I wanted to thank you for that.

591
00:45:41,550 --> 00:45:47,050
I-I'll reforge your sword for you,
so wait for it at the Butterfly Mansion.

592
00:45:47,560 --> 00:45:49,560
You're going to repair it for me?

593
00:45:49,560 --> 00:45:52,060
Don't you want me to fix it?

594
00:45:52,060 --> 00:45:53,600
Thank you very much!

595
00:45:53,940 --> 00:45:56,060
S-S-Sure.

596
00:45:56,770 --> 00:45:57,980
Mr. Haganezuka...

597
00:45:57,980 --> 00:45:59,780
Are you, like, embarrassed?

598
00:46:01,110 --> 00:46:02,320
Kotetsu!

599
00:46:02,320 --> 00:46:03,900
Young Kotetsu!

600
00:46:04,280 --> 00:46:05,910
Pretty funny, huh?

601
00:46:10,950 --> 00:46:13,830
No way am I embarrassed!

602
00:46:16,250 --> 00:46:19,000
Putting his foot in his mouth again!

603
00:46:16,250 --> 00:46:19,380
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

604
00:46:22,300 --> 00:46:25,470
But really, thank you so much!

605
00:46:25,470 --> 00:46:28,300
I'm going to work harder and harder!

606
00:46:28,800 --> 00:46:31,390
Yes! Good luck to you!

607
00:46:31,890 --> 00:46:33,600
All right, Kakushi.

608
00:46:33,600 --> 00:46:35,770
I'm counting on you.

609
00:46:36,440 --> 00:46:37,400
Huh?

610
00:46:38,230 --> 00:46:40,480
Now then, just as you did coming here...

611
00:46:40,480 --> 00:46:42,400
you'll wear this blindfold
and put in these nose plugs.

612
00:46:50,120 --> 00:46:52,620
All right, take care, everyone!

613
00:46:53,290 --> 00:46:54,960
I wish you good health!

614
00:46:54,960 --> 00:46:56,830
Please be careful!

615
00:46:56,830 --> 00:46:58,750
Please come back sometime, okay?

616
00:46:59,250 --> 00:47:01,210
Goodbye!

617
00:47:15,270 --> 00:47:16,980
What's the matter?

618
00:47:21,150 --> 00:47:22,650
Mr. Tanjiro...

619
00:47:27,450 --> 00:47:28,950
Tanjiro!

620
00:47:28,950 --> 00:47:30,120
Thanks!

621
00:47:30,120 --> 00:47:31,370
Thank you!

622
00:47:32,540 --> 00:47:33,490
Take care!

623
00:47:33,490 --> 00:47:35,540
You can count on us
to take care of your swords!

624
00:47:35,540 --> 00:47:36,460
Tanjiro!

625
00:47:36,460 --> 00:47:37,920
Hey, thanks!

626
00:47:37,920 --> 00:47:38,960
Tanjiro!

627
00:47:38,960 --> 00:47:40,460
Thanks!

628
00:47:43,170 --> 00:47:44,460
Thanks!

629
00:48:10,490 --> 00:48:15,450
Shall we do without the blindfold and nose plugs
until we've left this village?

630
00:48:16,200 --> 00:48:17,000
Yes!

631
00:48:17,000 --> 00:48:17,870
Thanks!

632
00:48:17,870 --> 00:48:18,960
Tanjiro!

633
00:48:20,250 --> 00:48:21,080
See you!

634
00:48:21,080 --> 00:48:21,920
Thank you!

635
00:48:21,920 --> 00:48:25,250
- Tanjiro!
- Thanks!

636
00:48:25,250 --> 00:48:27,800
- Thank you!
- Tanjiro!

